id = "book-inspct-001"
display_name = "Log-001"
description = "Tiny commentaries around this demo."
mesh = ExtResource("1_336in")
type = 2
is_storable = false
readable_text = "To whom it may concern,

Thank you for spending time with this humble simple tech demo. 

This project has been an amazing learning experience for me to understand \"composition-over-inheritance\" better as a game developer and it has served it's purpose albeit not becoming a full-fledged game with the time I've had with it.

Think about this space as a playable space without any game loops. Just a space to unwind and get back to reality for a short while.

Go! Interact with every interactables & enjoy your stay!"
